The leaderboard consists of 4 sections. You must be registered to see the players on the leaderboard or be on the leaderboards.
Leaderboard unlocks at 1 million score, or the first [[Achievements|achievement]].

The leaderboard is accessed through the [[Revolution]] tab.

The leaderboard is affected by many of your ingame stats. Below is the formula used for calculating your rank score:
<math display="block">
\text{Rank Score} = \begin{align} ( \\
&(1 + \lg(1 + \lg{\text{MaxScore}})) \\
&\times \sqrt{\text{MaxExponent}} \\
&\times (1 + \lg(1 +\text{MaxInfinites})) \\
&\times (1 + \lg(1 + \lg( 1 + \text{MaxIP})) \\
&\times \sqrt{1 + \frac{\text{MaxChallenges}}{10}} \\
&\times (1 + \frac{\text{MaxStars}}{8})^{0.3} \\
&\times (1 + \lg(1 + \text{Eternities}))^{0.25} \\
&\times (1 + \lg(1 + \lg(1 + \text{MaxEP})) \\
&\times \sqrt{1 + \frac{\text{MaxAnimals}}{9}} \\
&\times (1 + \frac{\text{MaxLabLevel}}{50})^{0.35} \\
&\times (1 + \frac{\text{MaxSupernova}}{10})^{0.6} \\
&\times (1 + \lg(1 + \lg(1 + \text{MaxDP})) \\
&\times (1 + \frac{\text{MaxDTP}}{8})^{0.8} \\
)^{0.35}
&\times (1 + \lg(1 + \text{MaxUnities})) \\
&\times \sqrt{1 + \frac{\text{MaxZodiacLevel}}{100}} \\
&\times \sqrt{1 + \frac{\text{MaxTrialCount}}{10}} \\
&\times (1 + \lg(1 + \text{MaxAttackLevel}))
\end{align}
</math>

